      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.13,
      "end_seconds": 9.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Morning, doctor, sorry about the rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.0,
      "end_seconds": 12.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.64,
      "end_seconds": 20.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "I've been getting puffed climbing stairs"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.16,
      "end_seconds": 23.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.16,
      "end_seconds": 38.39,
      "duration_seconds": 14.23,
      "text": "Hmm honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It It might have been last month or the month before I really can't pin it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.42,
      "end_seconds": 45.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Okay give me more detail on it it whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.77,
      "end_seconds": 62.51,
      "duration_seconds": 15.74,
      "text": "I notice it more with stairs. I'd say every other day. Severe I'd say. Oh uh and a bit of a cough with exercise. That's been about the same three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.02,
      "end_seconds": 66.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "how frequently does it it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.79,
      "end_seconds": 80.54,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "erm, it sort of comes and goes. I'd been feeling unfit, but that went away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.5,
      "end_seconds": 86.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "have you been getting puffed climbing stairs at any time before this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.56,
      "end_seconds": 96.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "Oh you know a bit last winter. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.16,
      "end_seconds": 102.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "did you get wheeze, palpitations, chest pain or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.21,
      "end_seconds": 108.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "So I haven't had wheeze palpitations chest pain or fainting no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.37,
      "end_seconds": 112.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Right is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.22,
      "end_seconds": 117.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "nothing unusual you know no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.97,
      "end_seconds": 121.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.45,
      "end_seconds": 124.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.8,
      "end_seconds": 142.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.35,
      "end_seconds": 149.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Foracort inhaler. I take it it twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.45,
      "end_seconds": 152.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Roughly how long on that one?"
